  "modified": "2026-10-15T07:13:43Z",
  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: fix denial of service in cupsd where a client holding\n     an in-flight Send-Document request stopped unrelated incomplete jobs\n     from timing out, allowing them to accumulate until MaxJobs.\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-107885.patch: give created jobs an absolute\n       pending timeout of now + MultipleOperationTimeout and stop deferring\n       the timeout for in-flight Send-Document requests once it passes in\n       create_job() and cupsdCheckJobs().\n     - CVE-2026-107885.\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: fix NULL pointer dereference in cupsd caused by\n     repeated IPP group tags in job-creation requests.\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-107890.patch: remove unnamed group\n       separator attributes from new job requests in add_job() and\n       add_job_subscriptions() in scheduler/ipp.c.\n     - CVE-2026-107890.",
